{"title": "Partial Ceremorphosis", "pageid": 29887, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Partial_Ceremorphosis", "categories": ["Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Partial_Ceremorphosis.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e6/Partial_Ceremorphosis.webp/300px-Partial_Ceremorphosis.webp, /w/images/e/e6/Partial_Ceremorphosis.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e6/Partial_Ceremorphosis.webp/300px-Partial_Ceremorphosis.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e6/Partial_Ceremorphosis.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Partial Ceremorphosis</b> is a special passive feature gained after consuming the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Astral-Touched_Tadpole\" title=\"Astral-Touched Tadpole\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cc/Astral_Tadpole_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Astral_Tadpole_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cc/Astral_Tadpole_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Astral_Tadpole_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cc/Astral_Tadpole_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Astral_Tadpole_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cc/Astral_Tadpole_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Astral_Tadpole_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cc/Astral_Tadpole_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Astral-Touched_Tadpole\" title=\"Astral-Touched Tadpole\">Astral-Touched Tadpole</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You are in the early stages of transformation - gaining access to more aberrant powers as you evolve your illithid potential. \n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\"> Details </span></h3>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">TAD_PARTIAL_CEREMORPH</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:TAD_PARTIAL_CEREMORPH\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:TAD_PARTIAL_CEREMORPH\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></dd>\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Other ways to learn:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Obtained by using or consuming the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Astral-Touched_Tadpole\" title=\"Astral-Touched Tadpole\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cc/Astral_Tadpole_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Astral_Tadpole_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cc/Astral_Tadpole_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Astral_Tadpole_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cc/Astral_Tadpole_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Astral_Tadpole_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cc/Astral_Tadpole_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Astral_Tadpole_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cc/Astral_Tadpole_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Astral-Touched_Tadpole\" title=\"Astral-Touched Tadpole\">Astral-Touched Tadpole</a>.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Once obtained, this passive can only be only removed with full <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ceremorphosis\" title=\"Ceremorphosis\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f8/Ceremorphosis_Icon.webp/20px-Ceremorphosis_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f8/Ceremorphosis_Icon.webp/30px-Ceremorphosis_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f8/Ceremorphosis_Icon.webp/40px-Ceremorphosis_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ceremorphosis\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f8/Ceremorphosis_Icon.webp/20px-Ceremorphosis_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f8/Ceremorphosis_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ceremorphosis\" title=\"Ceremorphosis\">Ceremorphosis</a>, or by destroying the Netherbrain (the character's appearance reverts in the epilogue). To selectively remove the cosmetic changes, see <a href=\"/wiki/Guide:Partial-illithid\" title=\"Guide:Partial-illithid\">Guide:Partial-illithid</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200503\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.050 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.056 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1503/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 13319/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5407/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 27/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 by